# Everything server-side is checked out on Linux. A CRLF that sneaks in from a
# Windows checkout turns into `bash: \r: command not found` on the VPS, which
# is a confusing failure at a bad moment. Pin these to LF regardless of the
# contributor's core.autocrlf.
*.sh              text eol=lf
*.service         text eol=lf
Caddyfile         text eol=lf
*.py              text eol=lf
*.jsonl           text eol=lf working-tree-encoding=UTF-8

# Prompt and consent files are Devanagari; never let a tool mangle them.
*.md              text eol=lf
*.json            text eol=lf

# Binary, hands off.
*.wav             binary
*.png             binary
*.ico             binary
